Description: KestrelCut - feather-light, crash-proof cross-platform video editor
 Professional non-linear video editing with GPU-accelerated UI, hardware
 accelerated H.264/H.265/AV1 export, real color wheels and scopes, proxy
 workflows for low-spec machines. FFmpeg is bundled — works offline.
